# Blackcountry HR System — locked brand & names

## Product brand (user-chosen — do not rename without asking)
- **Display name:** Blackcountry HR System
- **Source of truth:** `src/lib/brand.ts` (`PRODUCT_NAME`)
- **Workspace folder:** `WORKSPACE_ROOT_FOLDER` in `src/lib/brand.ts` (Google Drive / OneDrive)
- **Concept:** All-in-one platform for HR people ops + payroll
- **Co-pilot voice:** Omni Co-Pilot
- Repo folder: `blackcountry-hr`; user-facing strings use **Blackcountry HR System**

## Org language
- **Group company** — parent / holding workspace (Blackcountry Group)
- **Sub-company** — separate legal employer under the group (not a department)
- **Group tree:** Blackcountry Farms; Blackcountry Engineering, which itself has sub-companies (Design, Interiors, Construction, Machinery, Automation)

## Portal users
- **Group CEO** — Super Admin of the group
- **Super Admin** — a seat on the group and every sub-company (payslip approval for that company)
- **Business head** — lead of one sub-company (distinct login from Super Admin)
- **HR** — creates people; issues full-time logins; payroll draft; forwards approved run to Finance
- **Finance** — own portal; processes payroll; does not hire or create logins
- **Staff** — full-time only: own details, leave, timesheets, files (view), and company requests

## Employee status / sex labels
Use exact labels in `src/lib/employees/status.ts`.

## Approval language
- HR submits for Super Admin approval; Super Admin is notified and approves or sends back
- After Super Admin approval, HR forwards to Finance; Finance processes and notifies HR when complete
